purpose: >
  The protocol's blank-slate UI substrate: stateless Lit custom elements plus the tokens and
  light-DOM globals they consume, organised as single-concern pnpm workspace packages (elohim-core
  for tokens and atoms, elohim-shell for host chrome, and one package per pillar: imagodei, lamad,
  shefa, qahal, doorway, avodah). Every package depends on elohim-core and nothing else.
